{"id":1159,"date":"2021-10-27T05:07:55","date_gmt":"2021-10-27T05:07:55","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=1159"},"modified":"2026-07-31T13:22:12","modified_gmt":"2026-07-31T13:22:12","slug":"magento-vs-woocommerce-comparison","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/magento-vs-woocommerce-comparison\/","title":{"rendered":"Magento vs WooCommerce Comparison 2026: All Differences"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>If you&#8217;re planning to start your online business and couldn&#8217;t decide on the platform to start with, we understand that you&#8217;re in a difficult situation. But don&#8217;t worry, you&#8217;re at the right place. We will help you out to choose the most suitable platform as per your needs.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Indeed, WooCommerce and Magento are considered the most popular eCommerce platforms in the eCommerce software industry. As of April 2021, WooCommerce holds 23.43% of the market, while Magento ranks lower with a share of 2.32%. There is a huge gap in their market share but wait for more conclusions as there is much more to this.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is WooCommerce?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><a aria-label=\" (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"https:\/\/woocommerce.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WooCommerce <\/a>is a powerful plugin for the WordPress platform and is the most used eCommerce platform by a great number of people. It is an open-source software system to create some amazing websites and blogs. Launched in 2011, WooCommerce has been continuously conquering the WordPress industry.&nbsp;<br><\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"512\" height=\"208\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/woocommerce-for-ecommerce.png\" alt=\"woocommerce for ecommerce\" class=\"wp-image-1162\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wsc